      "cooked": "<p>Hi! We are looking for agency or implementation partner who has a ready to show modules to implement a tailored solution for empty container operations.</p>\n<p>Our key priorities include:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Yard Management</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Inland Container Depots (ICDs) &amp; Empty Container Depots (ECDs)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Bonded Warehouse Gate Operations</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Container Inventory Management</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Billing &amp; Invoicing</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Operational &amp; Financial Reporting</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> 3PL Management</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Integration with Shipping Lines &amp; Customs Platforms</p>\n<p>Ideal Experience:</p>\n<p>Proven ERP Next implementation track record</p>\n<p>Expertise in logistics and yard operations</p>\n<p>Integration with external systems (shipping lines, customs, etc.)</p>\n<p>Deep understanding of ERP billing and reporting modules</p>\n<p>We’re aiming for a robust, scalable, and future-ready system that supports our operational growth.</p>",
